        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Verizon North Inc. (North Central Region) and the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers agree to make available to employees who retire on or after July 1, 1997 with a service or disability pension under the GTE Pension Plan, a $5,000 retiree life insurance benefit. For employees who retire on or after July 1, 2003 with a service or disability pension under the GTE Pension Plan, a $10,000 retiree life insurance benefit will be available.",
